  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.43C). None between the vendor's code and the schematic: every pin in bsp_config.h is the net the schematic's GPIO table and panel connector give that GPIO. Waveshare runs this glass under orientation byte 0xC0 with the picture starting at column 8, and the preset does the same: the byte is on the Display tab, and a turned design is turned over it. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
